To demonstrate these principles in a concrete, production-ready implementation, we author a complete **Headless Agent Daemon** in TypeScript. This daemon connects to a distributed Redis queue, acquires distributed locks, monitors execution via a dead-man heartbeat watchdog, executes Claude Code inside a cleanroom, and generates cryptographically verifiable audit logs.

